# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private corpus / memory data — NEVER commit. The context engine operates over
# a private corpus that lives OUTSIDE this repository. These patterns block the
# common landing spots so corpus content, hot/cold artifacts, transcripts,
# provenance manifests, and indexes can never be staged from a working tree.
# See docs/security-and-privacy.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_organized/
_hot/
_held/
_inbox/
_provenance/
transcripts/
projects/
archives/
Archives/
corpus/
secrets/
backups/

# Generated corpus artifacts, indexes, and provenance ledgers
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.jsonl
*.gate.json
qmd_output_samples/

# Archives / backups
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.bak

# Secrets / environment
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

